{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5000_place", "source_sha256": "869bfa1cb35fc4385cb1b8adc093f9b353080734b744fa95bce4955a685bf128", "ja": "ＴＶ局スタジオ内", "zh": "电视台演播室内", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5001_p", "source_sha256": "1f74141230bda62ac433b3fb86a81a560be0a40ba42a3c28c66a73b467682efe", "ja": "（今日はバラエティ番組の収録。\n『アイドル抜き打ち学力テスト』に杏奈が参戦中だ）", "zh": "（今天是综艺节目的录制。杏奈正在参加《偶像突击学力测试》）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5002_024ann", "source_sha256": "0799a8056c62248a958b85d52828823408dcc81aeaf4ce53646df3792673cf57", "ja": "うぅ……抜き打ちテストなんて……。\n杏奈、聞いて……ない……。", "zh": "呜呜……突击测验什么的……\n杏奈……完全没听说过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5003_p", "source_sha256": "79ebabf729883ce93d8046b34b47f626ed4e287522a84f59315a3a4f53ab0909", "ja": "まあ抜き打ちだし……でも面白かったぞ？\nほら、バッハの肖像画で、ゲームキャラ答えた時！", "zh": "毕竟是突击测验嘛……不过还挺有意思的，对吧？就比如看到巴赫的肖像画时，你却答了个游戏角色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5004_024ann", "source_sha256": "b3fd3c9ed24db4b05eb6e1c5a8f992b3609594301395cdcb31c4f8a3df056f63", "ja": "あ……あれは……だって、似てたから……。\n{$P$}さん、意地悪、です……。", "zh": "啊……那个……因为看起来很像嘛……。\n{$P$}先生，真坏……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5005_p", "source_sha256": "e10149c214dc50ff7cc31cf98b8326b7f01c56ba6bff6092644edfc674b8e58c", "ja": "はは、ごめんごめん。でも盛り上がったしな。\n撮れ高はバッチリだったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，抱歉抱歉。不过气氛确实炒热了嘛。\n拍出来的效果特别好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5006_024ann", "source_sha256": "6b98549c036f05d7b5bc1a5b73c6614d6790cbf79b47dd3448f0a11a93ff304e", "ja": "でも、杏奈……全然、正解できて、ない……。\nどうしよう、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "可是，杏奈……完全没答对……。\n怎么办，{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5007_024ann", "source_sha256": "6ae771b93168095b1b34e31c520c7a6b0894372ab94c86028b52e3aa783428f4", "ja": "このままじゃ、負けちゃいます……うぅ。", "zh": "这样下去会输掉的……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5008_p", "source_sha256": "f524aa8388edf6788e6ca0d3596caada3ec3c60ef7fa2f23f8222480bb35d863", "ja": "そうだなぁ、休憩中に、できる対策は……。", "zh": "是啊……在休息时间，能采取的对策有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5009", "source_sha256": "89616511156383b29798f16c2f36470d6882379f30a6c990a7f5efa6b1efccfe", "ja": "直前まで予習", "zh": "预习到刚才为止", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5010", "source_sha256": "88f6048f6874aa2d0acaee992e1499761378e37f438f693babbaebb691f680df", "ja": "リアクションでカバー", "zh": "用回应来覆盖", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5200_p", "source_sha256": "8e44bf4e1b451cf305d1b24d0e0160f20e63eaa34483a22a4a8ff6c36c8dbc14", "ja": "今のうちに、予習をしてみたらどうだ？\n少しは、正解率のアップに繋がるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "趁现在先预习一下怎么样？\n多少能提高一点正确率吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5201_024ann", "source_sha256": "cbbe824930e71b5f2ca9f74d7743a405a830f177b17d05e624cb17308936bd10", "ja": "そう、だよね……。いくつか、テストやって……\n問題の傾向……なんとなく、わかってきた……かも？", "zh": "嗯，说得也是……做了几套测试……\n题目的类型……好像渐渐……有点明白了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5202_024ann", "source_sha256": "6224f8d94b270defff1a21daeee8a18a1f6c505b689b6ffe61db0b7b6d3fc220", "ja": "杏奈、頑張ってみる、から……。\n{$P$}さん……付き合って、くれる？", "zh": "杏奈会努力试试的……{$P$}先生……愿意陪杏奈一起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5300_p", "source_sha256": "8e44bf4e1b451cf305d1b24d0e0160f20e63eaa34483a22a4a8ff6c36c8dbc14", "ja": "今のうちに、予習をしてみたらどうだ？\n少しは、正解率のアップに繋がるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "趁现在先预习一下怎么样？\n多少能提高一点正确率吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5301_024ann", "source_sha256": "64e84a9039a7252f16049c272568b66ee1bcdfc339c2d4b6342b6549bcaf43b8", "ja": "ん、わかった……。じゃあ、\n過去問とか、調べてみる、ね……。", "zh": "嗯，知道了……那我去查查，历年的题目什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5302_024ann", "source_sha256": "91e3956c13b668a558d628b6a5c5714a9fdec27c6bd135a375c3c52e09771e13", "ja": "全部見られるかは、わからない、けど……。\nやらないよりは……いい、よね……？", "zh": "不知道能不能全部看完……不过，总比什么都不做……要好，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5500_p", "source_sha256": "f533269e9519b2d6a05c0a101bb805632e32f02bfdfccf2e05db93b059d14f46", "ja": "リアクションを頑張ってみたらどうだろう？\nバラエティ番組なんだし。", "zh": "试着在给出反应上多下点功夫怎么样？\n毕竟是综艺节目嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5501_024ann", "source_sha256": "a25763941a3b2e1256d1d934289a073b2329db6f98f5673dcb0b84c32b112b65", "ja": "あ……杏奈、正解しなきゃって、思って……。\nいつもより……反応、薄かった……かも？", "zh": "啊……杏奈想着，一定要答对才行……。\n所以……反应可能比平时……冷淡了些？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5502_024ann", "source_sha256": "00ca7ac64a24ec065edd1b7db67e0ba66677abd33d3d6178d977390b3da5e480", "ja": "見てくれる人が……ちゃんと、楽しめるように……。\n杏奈……ビビッと元気に、頑張ります……♪", "zh": "为了让看的人……能好好地、开心……。杏奈……要活力满满地、加油……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5600_p", "source_sha256": "f533269e9519b2d6a05c0a101bb805632e32f02bfdfccf2e05db93b059d14f46", "ja": "リアクションを頑張ってみたらどうだろう？\nバラエティ番組なんだし。", "zh": "试着在给出反应上多下点功夫怎么样？\n毕竟是综艺节目嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5601_024ann", "source_sha256": "5d7b64df12e7d07ed9c660ca648fcb25ebf14a719a4d1ed2d5fde1421cce3c54", "ja": "えっ……ちゃんと答えなくていいの……？\nでもそっか、杏奈、アイドルだもんね……。", "zh": "咦……不用好好回答也可以吗……？\n不过也是，杏奈毕竟是偶像嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_5602_024ann", "source_sha256": "b0d49e4e8dea4b31927d5424be9f1e276a6742ca1a5b8cd614198f851232fa88", "ja": "間違っても、いいって、思ったら……。\nちょっと、気が楽に……なってきた、かも……えへへ。", "zh": "如果觉得犯错也没关系……\n心情好像……轻松了一点……也许吧……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
